<%--
  The san pham dung chung (trang chu, danh sach). Dung trong vong <c:forEach var="p" ...>: p = Product. Du lieu nhap tay luon qua <c:out>.

  CACH DUNG
    Dat trong vong lap, ten bien vong lap PHAI la "p":
        <c:forEach var="p" items="${...}">
          <%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/common/product-card.jspf" %>
        </c:forEach>
    Hien duoc dung o: customer/home.jsp (san pham noi bat) va customer/products.jsp (danh sach co loc/phan trang).
    "include file" la gop file luc BIEN DICH JSP (khong phai goi them 1 request), nen file nay dung chung duoc cac bien cua trang cha.

  DU LIEU FILE NAY DOC TU TRANG CHA (khong tu khai bao)
    p                : Product dang xet (id, name, price, stockQuantity, imageUrl, category). Category la @ManyToOne eager nen doc duoc.
    ctx              : duong dan goc cua ung dung (vd "" hoac "/ecommerce"), duoc dat boi common/head.jspf nen trang cha phai include head.jspf truoc.
    cartCsrfToken    : token chong CSRF cho form them vao gio. Servlet cua trang (HomeServlet, ProductServlet) goi CartCsrf.prepare(req) de
                       dat vao request; khach CHUA dang nhap thi khong co token (o trong de trong, server se bat dang nhap truoc).
    taglib c, fm    t    : khai bao lai o dau file nay de file con dung doc lap duoc khi gop vao trang khac.

  BAO MAT
    Moi chuoi do Admin/nguoi dung nhap (ten, danh muc, duong dan anh, token) di qua <c:out> de ma hoa HTML -> chan XSS.
    Cac gia tri con lai la SO do he thong sinh (id, gia, ton kho) nen in thang duoc.
--%>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="fmt" uri="jakarta.tags.fmt" %>
<div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 hover:shadow-lg transition">
  <div class="relative">
    <%-- ANH: co imageUrl thi hien anh that (anh Admin tai len "uploads/..." hoac anh mau "static/img/..." deu ghep sau ctx);
         chua co anh thi hien o placeholder voi icon bong lua mi. Ca hai deu bam vao de mo trang chi tiet (placeholder khong phai link). --%>
    <c:choose>
      <c:when test="${not empty p.imageUrl}">
        <a href="${ctx}/product?id=${p.id}">
            <%-- .pc-img: bat dau opacity 0, onload them lop is-loaded de anh HIEN DAN khi tai xong (design.css) -> chuyen danh muc khong bi nhay anh.
                 decoding="async": cho trinh duyet giai ma anh khong chan viec ve trang. h-44 + object-cover: khung co dinh, anh cat vua khung. --%>
            <img src="${ctx}/<c:out value='${p.imageUrl}'/>"
                alt="<c:out value='${p.name}'/>"
                class="pc-img h-44 w-full object-cover rounded-t-[var(--radius-box)] bg-base-200" decoding="async" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')">
        </a>
      </c:when>
      <c:otherwise>
        <div class="ph rounded-t-[var(--radius-box)] h-44"><i data-lucide="wheat" class="size-12 text-primary/50"></i></div>
      </c:otherwise>
    </c:choose>
    <%-- NHAN TON KHO (goc tren phai anh): het hang (0) = nhan xam; sap het (1-5) = nhan vang kem so con lai.
         Nguong 5 khop voi "sap het hang" ben Admin (AdminStatsService.LOW_STOCK_LIMIT). Con nhieu hon 5 thi khong hien gi. --%>
    <c:if test="${p.stockQuantity == 0}"><span class="badge badge-neutral absolute top-2 right-2">Hết hàng</span></c:if>
    <c:if test="${p.stockQuantity > 0 && p.stockQuantity <= 5}"><span class="badge badge-warning absolute top-2 right-2">Chỉ còn ${p.stockQuantity}</span></c:if>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body p-4 gap-1">
    <span class="text-xs text-base-content/60"><c:out value="${p.category.name}"/></span>
    <%-- Ten san pham: toi da 2 dong (line-clamp-2), chieu cao toi thieu 2 dong (min-h-10) de cac the cung hang cao bang nhau du ten dai hay ngan. --%>
    <a href="${ctx}/product?id=${p.id}"
        class="font-semibold leading-snug line-clamp-2 min-h-10 hover:text-primary">
    <c:out value="${p.name}"/>
    </a>
    <%-- Gia: dinh dang so kieu 1,250,000 roi them ky hieu dong. Luu y: fmt chi nhan so (price la double), khong phai chuoi. --%>
    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary"><fmt:formatNumber value="${p.price}" pattern="#,##0"/>₫</span>
    <%-- htmx: bam -> POST /cart (action=add) -> chi doi badge #cart-count tren header, khong reload. Chua dang nhap: server tra HX-Redirect toi /login.
         Luong chi tiet:
           1. Form co CA "method=post action=..." (de van chay neu khong co JavaScript) VA hx-post (htmx gui nen khi co JavaScript).
           2. hx-target="#cart-count" hx-swap="outerHTML": ket qua server tra ve (doan HTML badge moi) THAY THE nguyen phan tu #cart-count.
           3. hx-disabled-elt="find button": khoa nut trong luc dang gui de bam dup khong them 2 lan.
           4. Thanh cong/that bai: CartServlet gui toast qua header HX-Trigger (khong doi noi dung the san pham).
         Cac o an: action=add chon thao tac cua CartServlet; cartCsrfToken chong gia mao yeu cau; productId la san pham nay; qty co dinh 1
         (muon chon so luong thi vao trang chi tiet). Server van kiem tra lai ton kho, khong tin nut bi disabled phia trinh duyet. --%>
    <form method="post" action="${ctx}/cart" class="mt-2" hx-post="${ctx}/cart"
          hx-target="#cart-count" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-disabled-elt="find button">
      <input type="hidden" name="action" value="add">
      <input type="hidden" name="cartCsrfToken" value="<c:out value='${cartCsrfToken}'/>">
      <input type="hidden" name="productId" value="${p.id}">
      <input type="hidden" name="qty" value="1">
      <%-- Het hang: nut bi disabled va doi chu thanh "Het hang". --%>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm btn-block" ${p.stockQuantity <= 0 ? 'disabled' : ''}>
        ${p.stockQuantity <= 0 ? 'Hết hàng' : 'Thêm vào giỏ'}
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
